!!! archon/engine/scanner.mat
!!! The Archon scanner: target and rules in, findings and report out.
!!!
!!! `scan` walks the target's lines, applies every rule to every line, and
!!! returns the findings in deterministic order (line, then rule). `summarize`
!!! folds the findings into the report's highest severity.

book archon.engine.scanner

read everything from ny.lang.core
read everything from archon.model.severity
read everything from archon.model.confidence
read everything from archon.model.category
read everything from archon.model.location
read everything from archon.model.finding
read everything from archon.model.rule
read everything from archon.model.target
read everything from archon.model.report
read everything from archon.engine.patterns
read everything from archon.engine.rules

!!! Scan a target with a set of rules and return the findings.
public scan receives target as scan-target, rules as array of knowledge-rule returns array of finding begin paragraph
    variable findings as array of finding is []
    value lines is split-lines with content being target.content
    variable line-number as number is 0
    variable next-identity as number is 1
    repeat for each line in lines
        set line-number to line-number plus 1
        repeat for each rule in rules
            when rule-matches with rule being rule, line being line then
                value place is build location with target being target.label, path being target.label, line being line-number, column being 0, excerpt being line
                append (finding-from-rule with rule being rule, place being place, identity-value being next-identity) to findings
                set next-identity to next-identity plus 1
            end when
        end repeat
    end repeat
    give findings
end paragraph

!!! Fold a set of findings into the report for their target.
public summarize receives target as scan-target, findings as array of finding, rules-applied as number returns scan-report begin paragraph
    variable highest as severity is severity.Info
    repeat for each item in findings
        when (severity-rank with level being item.level) is greater than (severity-rank with level being highest) then
            set highest to item.level
        end when
    end repeat
    give build scan-report with target-label being target.label, finding-count being (the length of findings), highest-level being highest, rules-applied being rules-applied
end paragraph
